Liseuse (provisional name) - a modified version of Readest

This program is a modified version of Readest
(https://github.com/readest/readest), Copyright (C) Bilingify LLC and the
Readest contributors, licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License,
version 3 (see LICENSE).

Modified on 2026-11-21 and later; every change is in this repository's git
history (branch play-release). The modifications are released under the same
license.

Main modifications:
- a new look and design system (colours, type, shapes; light, sepia, dark
  and OLED black themes);
- a redesigned library ("Continue reading" card, filter chips, bottom bar)
  and reading screen (bottom tools, theme panel, read-aloud player);
- translation of books into French and reading them aloud, through a relay
  (relay/fish-audio);
- no Readest account or Readest server: sign-in, cloud sync and storage,
  shared links, "Send to Readest", online metadata search, purchases and
  usage statistics are switched off (src/services/features.ts).

Complete corresponding source code: https://github.com/DamsCA/readest
